                    gala_purist:            `All-serious programme — maximise critical credibility, ignore the attendance number`,
                    r4_defense_label:       `Your 3-minute defence to the cultural authority's review panel:`,
                    defense_reconcile:      `Reconcile all three: show where you directed, where you enabled, and how quality, attendance and trust moved together`,
                    defense_qualityonly:    `Lead with the quality rating only — attendance and trust are secondary`,
