                    outcome_MandateRenewed:        `Mandate renewed — convincingly`,
                    outcome_RenewedOnTheWire:      `Mandate renewed — on the wire`,
                    outcome_WonNumbersLostEnsemble:`Numbers hit, ensemble lost`,
